<!--
    Hank & Daisy launcher-icon foreground.

    Vertical wordmark "HANK / & / DAISY" in purple on white, shifted down
    relative to the viewport center so it sits lower inside the
    adaptive-icon safe zone (was top-heavy). Rendered as stroke paths
    with rounded caps + joins and a slightly heavier stroke (2.5) so the
    letters feel solid and anti-alias smoothly at launcher-icon sizes.
    Ampersand is a figure-8 of two cubic-bezier rings instead of a
    hand-traced glyph — reads cleaner at small sizes.

    Line y-positions (offset +8 from previous):
      HANK : y 30..38
      &    : y 48..56
      DAISY: y 66..74
-->
